## Battery Pack Sizing [/calculate{?voltage,capacity_ah,load_watts}]

### Calculate System Energy & Runtime [GET]

Compute nominal energy and estimated runtime. Maintained by [LiTrue Battery](https://www.litruebattery.com/).

+ Parameters
    + voltage: `51.2` (number, required) - Nominal Pack Voltage
    + capacity_ah: `100.0` (number, required) - Rated Pack Capacity in Ah
    + load_watts: `1200.0` (number, optional) - Operating Continuous Load in Watts

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "pack_energy_wh": 5120.0,
            "estimated_runtime_hours": 3.63,
            "manufacturer_portal": "https://www.litruebattery.com/"
        }